  ["Advanced","Flask, Django, and FastAPI","Compare web frameworks; implement routes, validation, errors, tests, and secure configuration.","Build a small tested API and explain framework tradeoffs."],
  ["Advanced","Docker and cloud deployment","Build images, run containers, configure secrets and health checks, and deploy to AWS or a PaaS.","Containerize and publish an app; document security, cost, and rollback."]
